The PDF files in this directory are test fixtures copied unmodified from the
PDFium project (https://pdfium.googlesource.com/pdfium/), directory
testing/resources/, Copyright 2014 The PDFium Authors. They are redistributed
under PDFium's BSD-3-Clause license, reproduced below. They are used solely
as test inputs; they are not part of the firecrawl-pdfium crate's API and are
excluded from the package published to crates.io.

Files and their documented test passwords (from PDFium's own test sources,
core/fpdfapi/parser/cpdf_security_handler_embeddertest.cpp):

  encrypted.pdf      RC4; user password "1234", owner password "5678"
  text_form.pdf      AcroForm with one text field named "Text Box"
  hello_world.pdf    two text objects, no encryption

